<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="3."><l>Lord, in our eyes You are worthy,</l><l>And what we have, Lord, we give.</l><l>Breaking our flask we anoint Thee,</l><l>What is most precious we spend.</l><l>All our heart’s ointment so costly,</l><l>Lord, we pour out on Thee.</l><l>May all the house be filled, Lord,</l><l>With fragrance sweet to Thee.</l><l>May Your whole church then hunger,</l><l>With more desire for Thee.</l><l>Lord, may we always be,</l><l>With You in Bethany.</l><l>Our free will offering,</l><l>The best, poured out on Thee.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
